OL,3,GNEWSAFestive lights to twinkle in four
OL,4,ABournemouth areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FFestive lights are set to twinkle in
OL,7,Ffour areas of Bournemouth this year
OL,8,Fafter the town council approved
OL,9,Ffunding.
OL,11,FBournemouth, Christchurch and Poole
OL,12,F(BCP) Council stopped funding Christmas
OL,13,Flights in 2023 because of budget
OL,14,Fpressures.
OL,16,FUnder a pilot project, Charminster,
OL,17,FKinson, Winton and Moordown will each
OL,18,Fget 20 columns of blue and white
OL,19,Ftwinkling lights on their high streets.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
