OL,3,GNEWSAFestive lights to twinkle in four
OL,4,ABournemouth areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bournemouth Town Council scheme
OL,7,Fwill cost just under #56,000 and cover
OL,8,Fthe new 80 light columns. It will be
OL,9,Freviewed next year, with the
OL,10,Fpossibility of extending it to other
OL,11,Fareas.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
